{"mem_mo0itqwl_28b9c731b5af":{"concepts":["venture-hub","ecosystem-connectivity","ecosystem","connectivity"],"content":"Civilization OS — Ecosystem Connectivity Map in venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-CONNECTIVITY.md: # Civilization OS — Ecosystem Connectivity Map # How ventures, repos, agents, frameworks, tools, and CSVs work together # Last updated: 2026-03-16 --- ## THE BIG PICTURE Every venture in Civilization OS is a node in a connected graph. When you touch one layer, it propagates through all others automatically. ``` HUMAN INTENT (Antwuan) ↓ venture-hub (Next.js platform) ↓ Supabase (source of truth) ├── business_ventures (687 ventures) ├── aoc_tasks (5,017 pending work items) ├── venture_metrics (MRR, CAC, LTV) ├── repositories (1,387 repos mapped) └── clickup_task_id (ClickUp sync) ↓","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.157Z","files":["venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-CONNECTIVITY.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqwl_28b9c731b5af","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Civilization OS — Ecosystem Connectivity Map in venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-CONNE","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.157Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqwu_e50a8d8b6009":{"concepts":["venture-hub","ecosystem-60-repos","ecosystem"],"content":"Civilization OS — 60-Repo Ecosystem Map in venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-60-REPOS.md: # Civilization OS — 60-Repo Ecosystem Map # Project: venture-hub # Last updated: 2026-03-17 # Maps each ecosystem repo to T7/CivOS canonical numbered folder # Status: installed ✅ | needs clone ⚠️ | not needed ⛔ ## T7 Destination Legend ``` 00-platform/   Infrastructure, config, venture-hub code 01-ventures/   All 687 ventures 02-agents/     Agent frameworks, BMAD, orchestration 03-automation/ n8n, scripts, crons, triggers 04-research/   DeerFlow, Firecrawl, scrapers, intelligence 05-capital/    Grants, formation, tax, funding tools 06-marketing/  Content, social, email, brand 07-revenue/    Gumroad, Stripe, monetization 08-operations/ ClickUp, SOPs, dashboards 09-knowledge/  Docs, frameworks, strategy ```","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.166Z","files":["venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-60-REPOS.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqwu_e50a8d8b6009","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Civilization OS — 60-Repo Ecosystem Map in venture-hub/docs/ECOSYSTEM-60-REPOS.m","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.166Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqx3_190db235161e":{"concepts":["venture-hub","domains","architecture"],"content":"Civilization OS — Domain Registry in venture-hub/docs/DOMAINS.md: # Civilization OS — Domain Registry # Last updated: 2026-03-17 --- ## ✅ CHOSEN PRIMARY DOMAIN: civos.com **Why CIVOS.com:** - Short, powerful abbreviation of Civilization OS - Works across all brands (IZA OS, AI Boss, Civilization OS) - Professional for client emails: `intake@civos.com`, `hello@civos.com`, `deliver@civos.com` - Easy to say, spell, and remember - Available (as of 2026-03-16 — register immediately) --- ## Domain Architecture | Domain | Purpose | Status | Priority | |--------|---------|--------|----------| | **civos.com** | Primary company hub — all ventures, intake, brand | 🔴 Register NOW | #1 | | **izaos.com** | IZA OS brand — agent platform, enterprise | 🔴 Register | #2 | | **buildwithiza.com** | Client acquisition funnel — \"get your site built\" | 🟡 Register later | #3 | | **aiboss.agency** | Agency positioning, freelance clients | 🟡 Register later | #4 |","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.174Z","files":["venture-hub/docs/DOMAINS.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqx3_190db235161e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Civilization OS — Domain Registry in venture-hub/docs/DOMAINS.md: # Civilization","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.174Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqxb_fb4163b0cc7e":{"concepts":["the-office","readme","portfolio"],"content":"The Office - Venture Portfolio Management in The office/README.md: # The Office - Venture Portfolio Management **Owner:** Antwuan Divine Johns (worldwidebro) A full-stack application for managing venture portfolios, tracking GitHub repositories, and monitoring business automation projects. ## Tech Stack ### ✅ Installed & Configured - **Frontend:** Next.js 16 + React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4 - **Backend:** Convex (serverless database + functions) - **Authentication:** Clerk - **Email:** Resend - **Analytics:** PostHog - **Error Tracking:** Sentry - **Cache/Redis:** Upstash - **Vector DB:** Pinecone - **Payments:** Paddle (API key needed) - **Deployment:** Vercel (ready) - **DNS:** Cloudflare (ready) ## Quick Start ### ✅ All Dependencies Installed","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.183Z","files":["The office/README.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqxb_fb4163b0cc7e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"The Office - Venture Portfolio Management in The office/README.md: # The Office ","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.183Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqxk_8f82fa98209e":{"concepts":["the-office","integration_architecture","ecosystem","architecture","integration","web"],"content":"🏗️ Integration Architecture — Civilization OS / Iza OS Ecosystem in The office/INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE.md: # 🏗️ Integration Architecture — Civilization OS / Iza OS Ecosystem > How The Office, Venture Hub, GitHub, ClickUp MCP, and Twenty CRM connect > to form a unified venture portfolio management flywheel. --- ## 🌐 The Three-Layer Architecture ``` ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │                     TWENTY CRM (Contact → Client → Deal)           │ │                     GraphQL API · Webhooks · Docker                │ │                     http://localhost:3001                          │ └──────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┘ │                  │                  │ Leads   │           Deals  │           Client │  data ▼                  ▼                  ▼ ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │                         THE OFFICE                                  │ │                    (Backend / Brain / Tasks)                         │ │                                                                     │","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.192Z","files":["The office/INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqxk_8f82fa98209e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"🏗️ Integration Architecture — Civilization OS / Iza OS Ecosystem in The office/","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.192Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqxs_eac90dc30474":{"concepts":["upnext","project_summary","up-next","web"],"content":"🎯 ALEXUS JOHNSON - UP NEXT PROJECT in Upnext/bw-001-up-next-business/planning/PROJECT_SUMMARY.md: # 🎯 ALEXUS JOHNSON - UP NEXT PROJECT **Venture Tag:** BW-001 (Beauty & Wellness #1) **Client:** Alexus Johnson **Email:** Thelacestress@gmail.com **Website:** https://www.up-next.today/ **GitHub:** https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next **Status:** ⏳ Proposal Sent - Awaiting Approval --- ## 📁 PROJECT FILES (ALL ON GITHUB) | File | Purpose | Link | |------|---------|------| | **WELCOME_PACKET.md** | Intro email to Alexus | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/WELCOME_PACKET.md) | | **CLIENT_ONBOARDING_QUESTIONNAIRE.md** | Discovery questions | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/CLIENT_ONBOARDING_QUESTIONNAIRE.md) | | **PROJECT_PLAN_PRICING.md** | $55K proposal | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/PROJECT_PLAN_PRICING.md) | | **TASK_CHECKLIST.md** | Complete task list | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/TASK_CHECKLIST.md) | | **COMPLETION_STATUS.md** | Remaining steps | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/COMPLETION_STATUS.md) | | **OPEN_SOURCE_STACK_BLUEPRINT.md** | 3-5 week build plan | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/OPEN_SOURCE_STACK_BLUEPRINT.md) | | **README.md** | Project overview | [View](https://github.com/Worldwidebro/bw-001-up-next/blob/main/README.md) |","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.200Z","files":["Upnext/bw-001-up-next-business/planning/PROJECT_SUMMARY.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqxs_eac90dc30474","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"🎯 ALEXUS JOHNSON - UP NEXT PROJECT in Upnext/bw-001-up-next-business/planning/P","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.200Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqy1_c22a259f9955":{"concepts":["upnext","readme","up-next","marketplace","mobile","web"],"content":"BW-001 Up Next — Code Repository in Upnext/bw-001-up-next-code/README.md: # BW-001 Up Next — Code Repository > Monorepo for the Up Next Marketplace: web app, mobile, backend, AI, and automation --- ## 📁 Repository Structure ``` bw-001-up-next-code/ ├── README.md                          ← You are here ├── apps/ │   ├── web/                           ← Next.js 14 web application │   │   ├── src/ │   │   │   ├── app/                   ← App Router (layout, pages) │   │   │   ├── lib/                   ← Utilities (stripe, data, supabase client/server) │   │   │   ├── types/                 ← TypeScript definitions (stylist, etc.) │   │   │   └── styles/               ← Global CSS │   │   ├── next.config.mjs │   │   ├── tailwind.config.ts │   │   ├── tsconfig.json │   │   ├── package.json","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.209Z","files":["Upnext/bw-001-up-next-code/README.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqy1_c22a259f9955","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"BW-001 Up Next — Code Repository in Upnext/bw-001-up-next-code/README.md: # BW-0","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.209Z","version":1},"mem_mo0itqya_b3a444339327":{"concepts":["autonomous-venture-studio","readme","ecosystem","architecture","integration","mobile"],"content":"🚀 Autonomous Venture Studio in autonomous-venture-studio/README.md: # 🚀 Autonomous Venture Studio **Core Business Logic & Orchestration System** ## 📊 Overview The Autonomous Venture Studio is the central nervous system of a $724M+ ecosystem managing 730+ entities across multiple business categories. This repository contains the core business logic, orchestration systems, and automation frameworks that power the entire venture studio. ## 🎯 Key Capabilities - **Business Entity Management**: 382 businesses worth $221.3M - **Repository Orchestration**: 204 repositories worth $15.4M - **Frontend Integration**: 26 mobile-optimized projects - **Revenue Tracking**: $300M ARR potential - **Automation Level**: 95% automated operations ## 🏗️ Architecture ### Core Systems - **Execution Orchestrator**: Main system coordination - **Business Ecosystem Visualizer**: Entity management & visualization - **Revenue Tracker**: Financial performance monitoring - **Process Cleanup Manager**: System optimization & maintenance - **Memory Optimized Repository Manager**: Efficient resource management ### Integration Points","createdAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.218Z","files":["autonomous-venture-studio/README.md"],"id":"mem_mo0itqya_b3a444339327","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"🚀 Autonomous Venture Studio in autonomous-venture-studio/README.md: # 🚀 Autono","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-04-15T20:46:47.218Z","version":1}}␀␀␀��␀␀���